0,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-12-12T19:33:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-16T18:36:02Z","closed_at":"2024-12-16T18:17:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100335","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100335.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100335.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-16T18:17:00Z"},"body":"Avoid all allocations (except the inital string one) in `ResourceUID::id_to_text`\r\n\r\nTo make sure I did not break anything, I tested the first few billion IDs, and then produced random ID for an hour and tested that they matched the result of the current implementation.\r\n\r\nIn terms of performance, I tested like that inside `Main::iteration` in release build.\r\n\r\n```\r\nuint64_t newCycles = 0;\r\nuint64_t oldCycles = 0;\r\n\r\nauto si = ResourceUID::get_singleton();\r\nfor(uint64_t i = 0; i < 10000; ++i)\r\n{\r\n  ResourceUID::ID id = si->create_id();\r\n  uint64_t start = __rdtsc();\r\n  String newString = si->id_to_text(id);\r\n  uint64_t end = __rdtsc();\r\n  String oldString = si->id_to_text_old(id);\r\n  uint64_t end2 = __rdtsc();\r\n  \r\n  newCycles += (end - start);\r\n  oldCycles += (end2 - end);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfloat avg  = oldCycles / 10000.0f;\r\nfloat avgN = newCycles / 10000.0f;\r\nfloat speedUp = avg / avgN;\r\nprint_line(vformat(\"(%f) - (%f) : %f\", avg, avgN, speedUp));\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich gives me an average of 6820 cycles for the old one and 231 cycles for the new one.\r\nSo about 29x speed up.\r\n![idtoText](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b16311dc-72f8-40df-a20e-0bc896cd95a7)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100335/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":5,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100335/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}